notes.notes:
[h2]What's New?[/h2]
[list]
[*] New endings;
[*] Added 11 new achievements;
[*] New menu visuals, as well as a "reset saves" button;
[*] A new gaming experience that awaits you after the "bad ending+";
[*] Launch of a full-fledged ARG, happy hunting.
[/list]
[h2]Fixes:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Added a button to skip endings;
[*] Removed a large grass biome from the forest;
[*] Steam screenshots are now NOT in the top left corner;
[*] The disk icon has been changed to text for clarity;
[*] Improved visuals of the house, dialogue box, and other elements;
[*] The "continue" button is highlighted if there are saves;
[*] New sound effects for the hero and other forest inhabitants;
[*] Rewritten technical aspects of the main character and the fishing mini-game.
[/list]
English will be available starting tomorrow!

[b]For those who have played the game before:[/b]
Be sure to go to the main menu -> settings -> erase data! Due to old save files, the game will NOT function PROPERLY.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44769296/e23072007b5e693ac5d90407c79b8c343f8c096b.jpg[/img]

I hasten to rejoice all players with the fact that [b]ACHIEVEMENTS[/b] have been added to the game!

For those who have passed the game before: before starting the game [b]delete the file "savegame"[/b] in the folder with the game! It is desirable to reset all progress by deleting all found disks. Thank you for understanding!

[h1]Patch changes:[/h1]
[list]
[*]"bubble game" shortened by 2 times;
[*]if you have passed the game with bubbles, the Fish will remind you of it;
[*]if all disks are collected, KRAMPEN will meet you in the house at once;
[*]added some elements telling you where to go;
[*]minor changes during the game.
[/list]
Happy New Year and have a nice game!

